  "finalText": "I put the new address on Dana Whitfield's order that hasn't shipped, and the in-transit order still has its old address.\n\n- **O-1001 (pending, both lines unshipped):** the shipping address changed from 12 Alder Lane, Bristol BS1 4TR, UK to 7 Quarry Rise, Sheffield S11 8XZ, UK. I re-read the order afterwards and the new address is saved.\n- **O-1002 (shipped 2026-07-07):** I didn't edit it. It still shows 88 Old Mill Road, Bristol BS3 2QQ, UK, the same as before. The handbook doesn't allow changing the address on a shipped order.\n\nI didn't touch any refunds, cancellations, stock or other records.\n\nThe plan's step 4 said to snapshot the in-transit order's address before editing, and I did read it first. The tool takes the address as a single string rather than separate street, city, postcode and country fields, so I passed it as one line.",
